Smart IPTV player is a simple and convenient app for looking a live-streams or your favorites TV channels. You can enjoy watching anywhere you have access to the Internet. If you need to urgently reply to a message or take a photo, simply minimize the application and the broadcast will continue in a separate window on your device. For the most demanding users, it is possible to download data about the program for TV channels from external sources. If the data matches, information about the current broadcast will be displayed for such channels.

The app provides:

- support the proprietary Apple AV player;
- M3U playlists manager;
- EPG manager (xml, gz formats allowed);
- support PiP mode

We recommend using the app on the iPhone 8 or later.

